<section class="hero" id="home">
  <div>
    <h1>Building a cleaner, greener, and more responsible barangay.</h1>
    <p>Barangay Eco Care helps residents and barangay personnel manage waste-related concerns, submit environmental reports, monitor community activities, and participate in a non-monetary rewards system — all in one platform.</p>
    <div class="hero-actions">
      <a href="/signup" class="btn btn-primary">Get started</a>
      <a href="#how" class="btn btn-ghost">See how it works</a>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="hero-preview">
    <div class="hero-preview-head">
      <span>Barangay overview</span>
      <span class="sample-tag">Sample data</span>
    </div>
