      <div class="hp-row"><span>Illegal dumping, Purok 1</span><span class="badge badge-resolved">Resolved</span></div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="section" id="features">
  <div class="section-head">
    <h2>Everything your barangay needs to keep clean</h2>
    <p>One platform for residents and officials to report, act, and track progress together.</p>
  </div>
  <div class="feature-grid">
    <div class="feature-card">
      <div class="feature-icon"><svg width="18" height="18" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="#2FB6A3" stroke-width="2"><path d="M4 7h16M9 7V4h6v3M6 7l1 13h10l1-13"/></svg></div>
      <h3>Waste reporting</h3>
      <p>Report overflowing bins, illegal dumping, and other waste concerns with photo evidence.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="feature-card">
      <div class="feature-icon"><svg width="18" height="18" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="#2FB6A3" stroke-width="2"><path d="M12 2v20M5 9l7-7 7 7"/></svg></div>
      <h3>Waste management</h3>
      <p>Barangay staff track, verify, and resolve reports from submission to resolution.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="feature-card">
      <div class="feature-icon"><svg width="18" height="18" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="#2FB6A3" stroke-width="2"><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="9"/><path d="M12 7v5l3 3"/></svg></div>
      <h3>Community monitoring</h3>
      <p>Staff and admins monitor report status and community participation in real time.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="feature-card">
      <div class="feature-icon"><svg width="18" height="18" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="#2FB6A3" stroke-width="2"><path d="M12 2l3 6 7 1-5 5 1 7-6-3-6 3 1-7-5-5 7-1z"/></svg></div>
      <h3>Rewards and points</h3>
      <p>Residents earn points for verified reports and proper segregation, redeemable for non-monetary incentives.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="feature-card">
      <div class="feature-icon"><svg width="18" height="18" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="#2FB6A3" stroke-width="2"><path d="M3 20s2-3 9-3 9 3 9 3M12 13a4 4 0 100-8 4 4 0 000 8z"/></svg></div>
      <h3>Environmental activities</h3>
      <p>Join clean-up drives, tree planting, and other barangay-organized environmental activities.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="feature-card">
      <div class="feature-icon"><svg width="18" height="18" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="#2FB6A3" stroke-width="2"><path d="M18 8a6 6 0 10-12 0c0 7-3 9-3 9h18s-3-2-3-9M13.73 21a2 2 0 01-3.46 0"/></svg></div>
      <h3>Notifications</h3>
      <p>Stay updated on report status, points earned, and barangay announcements.</p>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="section" id="how">
  <div class="section-head">
    <h2>How it works</h2>
    <p>From a single report to a cleaner community.</p>
  </div>
  <div class="steps-grid">
    <div class="step-item"><div class="step-tag">Step 1</div><h3>Create an account</h3><p>Register as a resident in a few minutes.</p></div>
    <div class="step-item"><div class="step-tag">Step 2</div><h3>Submit a report</h3><p>File a waste or environmental concern with details and photo.</p></div>
    <div class="step-item"><div class="step-tag">Step 3</div><h3>Barangay reviews</h3><p>Staff review and verify the report.</p></div>
    <div class="step-item"><div class="step-tag">Step 4</div><h3>Earn points</h3><p>Verified and resolved reports automatically earn points.</p></div>
    <div class="step-item"><div class="step-tag">Step 5</div><h3>Redeem rewards</h3><p>Trade points for barangay-provided, non-monetary incentives.</p></div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="section" id="about">
  <div class="section-head">
    <h2>About Barangay Eco Care</h2>
  </div>
  <div class="about-block">
    <p>Barangay Eco Care was built to close the gap between residents who notice waste and environmental concerns in their community, and the barangay personnel responsible for acting on them. Instead of concerns going unreported or unresolved, every report is logged, tracked, and visible to both the resident who filed it and the staff assigned to handle it.</p>
    <p>The platform also recognizes residents who consistently practice proper waste segregation and participate in community reporting, through a points-based, non-monetary rewards system — encouraging habits that benefit the whole barangay, not just the individual.</p>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="section">
  <div class="section-head">
    <h2>Built for every role</h2>
    <p>Residents register directly. Staff and administrator access is assigned by the barangay.</p>
  </div>
  <div class="role-grid">
    <div class="role-card">
      <span class="role-tag tag-teal">Resident</span>
      <h3>Resident</h3>
      <p style="color:var(--ink-soft); font-size:14px;">Submit reports, track their status, earn points, and redeem rewards.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="role-card">
      <span class="role-tag tag-coral">Barangay staff</span>
      <h3>Barangay staff</h3>
      <p style="color:var(--ink-soft); font-size:14px;">Review and verify reports, manage residents, rewards, and activities.</p>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="cta-banner">
  <h2>A cleaner barangay starts with you.</h2>
  <p>Small actions make a big impact. Create an account to get started.</p>
  <a href="/signup" class="btn btn-outline-light">Get started</a>
</section>

